# Talent values (restoration_druid_talents.bat): every talent of the tree, tested at your limit on the same fights.
#   Talent: <name>  switches a talent of your build off (multi-rank talents lose every rank): what it is worth to you.
#   Add: <name>     takes a talent you don't have ON TOP of your build (no point removed): what it would add.
#   Swap: <a> for <b>  takes the other option of a choice node.
# Talents are given by trait entry id (<tree>_talents=<entry>:<rank>; the report maps them onto the tree). Rejuvenation
# can't be removed (other spells need it). Generated from the report JSON's talent_tree; regenerate when the build changes.
